<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62990" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστ-ρικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστικός</span>
			, for which it is a freq. v.l., of ships, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριακόντορος λ.</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῃστρίς</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				25
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. σκάφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.43
				</span></i>
			: metaph., of 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑταῖραι, τὰ λ. τῆς Ἀφροδίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.43
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Rufin.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				160
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Hedyl.
			</span></i> or <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τρόπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					1061.14
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			of persons, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.2.2
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. δύναμις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sert.</u>
					18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1256b1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔθνη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1338b23
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λ. ἦθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					12.8.9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λ. πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>Mith.</u>
					96
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					2.5.26
				</span></i>
			.</div>
